{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":30.290000915527344,"text":"Rows of marble heads carved about 2,000 years ago, they are not gods, they are people who lived in Thessaloniki, and it shows. One has a crooked nose, another a double chin, another a tight mouth. The Romans did not want their portraits prettified, they wanted them recognizable. Some heads have pupils carved into the eyes, which earlier sculptors did not do, and that is why their gaze seems to follow you.","words":[{"word":"Rows","start":0,"end":0.699999988079071},{"word":"of","start":0.699999988079071,"end":1.5199999809265137},{"word":"marble","start":1.5199999809265137,"end":1.5199999809265137},{"word":"heads","start":1.5199999809265137,"end":1.9600000381469727},{"word":"carved","start":1.9600000381469727,"end":2.5399999618530273},{"word":"about","start":2.5399999618530273,"end":2.9200000762939453},{"word":"2","start":2.9200000762939453,"end":3.5999999046325684},{"word":"000","start":3.5999999046325684,"end":3.680000066757202},{"word":"years","start":3.680000066757202,"end":4.079999923706055},{"word":"ago","start":4.079999923706055,"end":4.320000171661377},{"word":"they","start":4.960000038146973,"end":5.079999923706055},{"word":"are","start":5.079999923706055,"end":5.21999979019165},{"word":"not","start":5.21999979019165,"end":5.480000019073486},{"word":"gods","start":5.480000019073486,"end":5.960000038146973},{"word":"they","start":6.079999923706055,"end":6.559999942779541},{"word":"are","start":6.559999942779541,"end":6.880000114440918},{"word":"people","start":6.880000114440918,"end":7.260000228881836},{"word":"who","start":7.260000228881836,"end":7.679999828338623},{"word":"lived","start":7.679999828338623,"end":7.920000076293945},{"word":"in","start":7.920000076293945,"end":8.300000190734863},{"word":"Thessaloniki","start":8.300000190734863,"end":8.760000228881836},{"word":"and","start":9.180000305175781,"end":9.399999618530273},{"word":"it","start":9.399999618530273,"end":9.9600